SAP → Invests in AI and cloud innovations → Attracts large enterprises with mission-critical needs → Drives high switching costs and recurring revenue → Reinforces market leadership.  

This loop creates a self-reinforcing cycle, as SAP’s ecosystem becomes more valuable over time.  

